<p> Shr			 C$0.41		   C$0.10</p>
<p> Net			 33,345		    7,378</p>
<p> Revs		     285,499		   27,517</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Sherritt International Corp. No Q4 figures given. 1995 figures are for a 38-day period after Sherritt International Corp and Viridian Inc were spun-off by Sherritt Inc.</p>
